@host = http://localhost:8000

### Successful transfer
POST {{host}}/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{"from_account": "acc-1", "to_account": "acc-2", "amount": 10}

### Domain error — insufficient balance (422)
POST {{host}}/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{"from_account": "acc-1", "to_account": "acc-2", "amount": 9999}

### Domain error — account not found (404)
POST {{host}}/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{"from_account": "acc-x", "to_account": "acc-2", "amount": 1}

### Validation error (422)
POST {{host}}/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{"from_account": "", "to_account": "acc-2", "amount": -10}

### Unhandled exception (500)
GET {{host}}/boom

### HTTPException-driven (418)
GET {{host}}/teapot
